      }
    },
    "Aloha Social on GitHub" : {
      "comment" : "Menu item"
    },
    "Aloha Social shows posts from servers across the fediverse. Those servers are run by other people, and this app does not control what they publish." : {
      "comment" : "Terms gate explanation",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aloha Social zeigt Beiträge von Servern im gesamten Fediverse. Diese Server werden von anderen betrieben, und diese App hat keinen Einfluss darauf, was dort veröffentlicht wird."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aloha Social works with Nextcloud, Mastodon, and any server that speaks the Mastodon API." : {
      "comment" : "Sign-in explanation",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aloha Social funktioniert mit Nextcloud, Mastodon und jedem Server, der die Mastodon-API unterstützt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also" : {
      "comment" : "Related hashtags row lead-in",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Außerdem"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also send to their server" : {
      "comment" : "Report option",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Auch an deren Server senden"
