      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Immer anzeigen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An adjustment is baked into the copy that is posted; the original stays on your device." : {
      "comment" : "Photo filter explanation",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine Anpassung wird fest in die veröffentlichte Kopie übernommen; das Original bleibt auf deinem Gerät."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An alias says another account is also you. It is what lets followers be carried across when one account moves to the other." : {
      "comment" : "Migration alias explanation",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein Alias besagt, dass ein anderes Konto ebenfalls dir gehört. Dadurch können Follower mitgenommen werden, wenn ein Konto zum anderen umzieht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An archive from here or elsewhere" : {
      "comment" : "Migration import",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein Archiv von hier oder anderswo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An exclusive list's members appear only here, not in your home timeline." : {
      "comment" : "Exclusive list explanation",
      "localizations" : {
