    "Everything else an administrator does to this instance — storage, retention, relays, the blocklist — stays in the Nextcloud administration page." : {
      "comment" : "Moderation scope explanation",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alles andere, was die Administration an diesem Server einstellt – Speicher, Aufbewahrung, Relays, die Sperrliste –, bleibt in den Nextcloud-Verwaltungseinstellungen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything nobody has objected to trends already, so approving only records that you have looked. Rejecting is what keeps something out of Explore." : {
      "comment" : "Trends moderation explanation",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alles, wogegen niemand Einspruch erhoben hat, ist bereits im Trend. Genehmigen hält also nur fest, dass du es dir angesehen hast. Nur Ablehnen hält etwas aus „Erkunden“ heraus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything the server has learned goes, and the feed starts over." : {
      "comment" : "Interests reset confirmation detail",
